= Remote Console Commands:
 - test                                    - Send diagnostic report to target(s)
 - echo <msg>                              - Send <msg> to target(s)
 - spam <number> <msg>                     - Send <number> of messages <msg> to target(s)
 - delay <secs> <cmd>                      - Execute <cmd> after <secs> seconds
 - tasks                                   - Lists all active tasks
 - cancel <task_id>                        - Halt active tasks by task id
 - set <server|channel> <name|all>         - Target specific server/channel
 - servers                                 - List connected servers and channels
 - volume <number>                         - Changes volume to <number>%
 - reboot <-c>                             - Initiates reboot and updates. Optional -c flag will open console
 - help                                    - Show this help menu
```"
